WEBVTT

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.480
I don't want to!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.170
Have a good day!

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:10.260
Her preschool is closed today so she has the day off.

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:11.160
Have a good day!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.540
What?  She should be happy then, shouldn't she?

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:13.720
Have a good day!

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:14.980
Yes, but...

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.580
Have a good day!

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.750
I don't want to stay at home.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.060
Have a good day!

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:26.360
It's boring when I'm not with Kippei-onii-chan!

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.340
Have a good day!

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.980
You don't have to cry.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:29.630
Have a good day!

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.970
But...

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:34.190
Have a good day!

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:37.520
Okay, then maybe I'll take the day off from school too!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.090
Have a good day!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.000
Yay!

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:42.450
You idiot!  Hurry up and go.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:47.360
Have a good day!

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.700
I'm so lonely.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.200
Have a good day!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.800
It seems that you've picked up Nee-chan's mean mouth, doesn't it, Mom?

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.720
Have a good day!

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:56.090
I want to go to space.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.450
Have a good day!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:58.490
What are you saying?

00:02:58.490 --> 00:02:59.260
Have a good day!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.020
She's set on trying to get your attention.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:19.580
Have a good day!

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.720
I'm going!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:26.980
Have a good day!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.220
Be careful.
I'll be home soon, okay?  Bye!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:34.810
Have a good day!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.140
She's so cute!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.170
What should we play?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.020
Hey...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.010
What is it?

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:11.220
Do you have any stomach medicine?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.000
Do you feel better?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.240
A little bit.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.270
You drank too much.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.000
You're an adult already, so learn your limits.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.420
It's fine.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.810
Today's my day off from work anyway.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:30.530
Huh?

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:31.870
What is it?

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.010
Who is that person lying over there?

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:40.570
It's Yuzuyu-chan.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.410
She's bored because Kippei isn't around.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.250
She has the day off from school today.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.620
She's so close to Kippei.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.630
Tell me what's so good about him anyway?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:14.590
Acorn rolling, rolling.  Acorn...

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.970
Why don't you take her someplace?

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:23.900
Where?

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.750
How about an amusement park and then take her on a roller coaster ride?

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.800
Are you trying to kill me?  I'm hung over!

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.910
How about a Ferris wheel?

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.830
Just imagining it makes me nauseous!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.170
You're exaggerating.

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:37.480
Oh yeah,

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.990
Yuzuyu-chan, what would you like to eat for lunch?

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:45.740
Lunch?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:49.740
Yes, you're not eating from a lunch box today.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:52.530
Huh?  Lunch box?

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.510
Hey, hey!

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:01.720
What is it?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:08.640
Maybe I should make Kippei-onii-chan's lunch and take it to him!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:09.740
What's that?

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.770
That's great!  Seems like so much fun!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.470
That's a very exciting plan!

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.380
All right, now that we've decided...

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:25.990
Not yet?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.230
Just a bit longer.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.150
All right!  Yuzuyu-chan's cooking!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.930
Go ahead, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:39.540
I-I will be making a rice ball.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:44.890
First, lay down a damp napkin in the rice bowl.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.620
On top of that, you sprinkle a little bit of salt...

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.250
It's okay, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.320
Kippei's the one that's going to be eating it.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:07:00.920
N- Next, with a rice spatula, put rice on top of the napkin.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.040
Yuzuyu-chan, wait till after it's cooled down.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.700
You don't want to burn your hands.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:09.960
Okay!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.290
What's with that laughing?

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:23.360
I don't care, but if he's dreaming about us, I won't let him get away with it!

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.370
I'll sue him for unauthorized use of my image.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.970
Hey!  Let's put a lot of wasabi in one of them!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:46.070
Don't interfere with Yuzuyu-chan's wish.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.550
Want to put some salmon in it?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:48.840
Let's make all sorts!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.030
Is it fun!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:51.340
It's fun!

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:07.010
I made you a map, but if you get lost, ask someone for help, okay?

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:07.640
Okay!

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:10.540
But don't go with any suspicious people.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.160
Okay!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.370
I'm going!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:20.100
Take care!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.140
I better hurry...

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:25.870
Here, this.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:26.240
Huh?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.980
There's no way Yuzuyu-chan can make it on her own.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.470
She got lost last time.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:33.450
Then why?

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:36.600
It can't be helped.  She said she wanted to go on her own.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.720
So what is this?

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.420
They're your tools of disguise!  Get into disguise and follow Yuzuyu-chan!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.520
But why me?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.200
You're free, right?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.120
It's my day off!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.910
Hurry!

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:58.730
This is my thanks to you for making my lunch all the time, Kippei-onii-chan!

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.870
I hope he'll be pleased by it.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.410
Hurry!

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:23.440
Hurry!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.570
Hurry!  Hurry!  Hurry!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.360
The light's green!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.780
Right is okay!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.790
Left is okay!  And once again, right is okay!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.640
Dash!

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.840
Are you lost?

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.220
Which way was it?

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:14.900
Ask a nice person for directions.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.020
Excuse me...

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:22.960
What are you doing?!

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:27.730
Um, excuse me!

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:29.580
What's wrong?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.840
Good, good, good.

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:36.610
Can you please tell me how to get to this place on the map?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.930
Oh, Tohei High School.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.680
That's pretty close.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:44.600
My house is close by, so I'll take you there.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.600
Ma'am, are you a suspicious person?

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.750
Oh no, I'm not suspicious.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.380
Then please take me there!

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.430
This way.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:00.530
Okay.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:02.710
Good, good, good.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.080
Hey, hey, hey.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.920
Isn't it kind of suspicious?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.340
That's right, it's weird.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:11.600
How scary.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.720
Yes, it sure is.

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:13.980
Don't look.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.750
I don't even know what I'm doing this for.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.230
Here we are.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.680
Are you okay from here?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.760
Yes, thank you very much.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.720
You're welcome.  Goodbye.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.910
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.490
Stand.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.520
Bow.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:15.300
Kippei-kun, you wake up in time for lunch, huh?

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:16.070
Yeah.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.550
Kokoro, let's go buy some yogurt.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:19.290
Okay.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.350
I don't understand what Imai means.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.420
Was that really Japanese?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:24.600
Why?

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.660
There's been nothing since.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.640
I guess that's a given.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.930
Hey, let's go to the cafeteria.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:36.960
I have my lunch with me.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.630
Yeah, let's go.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.630
What's wrong?  If you don't go inside, you can't give it to him.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.870
Kippei-onii-chan's lunch.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.210
Go for it, Yuzuyu-chan!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:06.790
I wonder if the vending machines are crowded.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.950
How much do you have with you today?

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:14.510
How cute!

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:15.210
What is it?

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:16.720
Did something happen?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.210
Where are you from?

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.170
What's your name?

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.200
Where did you come from?

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.430
Tell us!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.740
U-Um, where's Kippei-onii-chan?

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.230
Kippei-onii-chan's lunch box.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.420
You've only been eating ramen lately.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:45.260
What happened to bread?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.420
Did you get sick of it?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.640
What flavor should I have today?

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:52.840
Kokoro-chan.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.610
She said she came all by herself.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:59.650
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.640
Why?!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:04.420
Don't scream.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.030
Who is she?  Is she your kid?

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.980
She's my cousin!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.520
Kippei's taking care of her.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.230
That's what she said earlier.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:16.840
Are you serious?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.230
I want a kid too!

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:23.270
Kippei's so cute!

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:24.730
What's your name?

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:25.780
It's Yuzuyu.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:26.880
Hey!!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.510
What's all this commotion about?!

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.510
Sensei, it's Kippei's cousin.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:33.520
Huh?

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:37.570
Hey!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.250
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:52.540
Yes!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.600
What are you doing here?

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.560
You were supposed to stay home today.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.000
Where are Mom and Nee-chan?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.890
I told them I'm going.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.730
What is my family thinking?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:07.860
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:09.140
What?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:13.920
I brought lunch for you, Kippei-onii-chan!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.150
I'm so embarrassed!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.840
You brought this just for me?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:38.570
Yep.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.770
Don't be so embarrassed.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.710
Thank you for this meal.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.360
Go ahead, Dear.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.450
Please eat a lot.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.010
D-Dear?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.200
Where did you learn such words?

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.790
Wow!  It's all rice balls!

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.170
There are all kinds of them.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.780
Okay then, I'll try this one first.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:26.940
Oh yeah!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.190
One, two, three...

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:42.840
It's delicious!!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.710
You have a lot of energy today, huh, Yuzuyu-san.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:55.250
Are you thirsty?  Can you drink that water?

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:56.580
Nope, you can't drink that.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.020
Although it is an unlimited supply.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.120
It's okay, I'm not thirsty.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.540
Is it really good?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:09.590
Yeah.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:32.340
It's delicious!!

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.020
Hey, it's Kippei.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.750
Bye-bye!

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:28.410
What?  Are you going home?

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:32.370
That's not fair.  At least take your bag with you.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.510
Yuzuyu!  Come by again!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.160
She shouldn't come that often.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.010
Bye-bye!

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:41.430
See you again!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.940
Yuzuyu!  See you!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.020
Bye-bye!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.270
Kippei, bye-bye!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.460
Do your best taking care of her!

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.720
Bye-bye!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.500
Kippei is great, after all!

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:03.100
I really like him.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.770
You're serious, aren't you?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:08.580
But honestly, his impression has improved.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:09.800
No way!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.380
What?  No?

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.580
About Kippei?

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:15.350
Huh?

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.500
What am I saying?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:47.310
Errand... errand... bringing lunch... to Kippei-onii-chan!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.900
Errands are fun.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.110
I'm surprised you came alone.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.380
You didn't get lost?

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.460
I asked a non-suspicious lady.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.720
A non-suspicious lady?

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.870
What kind of lady?

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.610
A suspicious person!

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:29.800
What?

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:31.640
Hey!

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:35.940
Nee-chan!

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.080
What are you doing?

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.470
Shut up!

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.190
What are you doing coming home?

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.960
What about school?!

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:50.550
What's with that outfit?  It's funny!

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.480
Let me go!  Let me go!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.300
It's cute!  It's gorgeous!

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:57.950
What part of this outfit is gorgeous?!

00:20:58.220 --> 00:20:59.370
It is gorgeous!

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.280
Really?

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:03.340
Yep!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.450
Let's go home together!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:09.110
Okay.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:20.710
Errand... errand... it's fun...

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:29.290
with Kippei-onii-chan and the gorgeous, gorgeous Onee-sama!  It's fun!

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:06.640
Yuzuyu...

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:21.220
Kippei-onii-chan, listen!

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:23.490
I got bigger!

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:24.890
Shush.  Be quiet.

00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:25.950
Shush?

00:24:26.280 --> 00:24:29.270
I heard that there's a suspicious person around the preschool.

00:24:29.590 --> 00:24:32.030
Suspicious?  Onee-sama?

00:24:32.030 --> 00:24:32.820
Again?

00:24:33.420 --> 00:24:34.460
N-No...

00:24:35.010 --> 00:24:40.170
She's much prettier and nicer than Nee-chan, and she's always been thinking about you.

00:24:41.460 --> 00:24:43.200
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:43.630 --> 00:24:44.220
Mama!

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:46.820
Where are you?
